---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
const linksClass = "w-fit font-bold";
---

<Layout title="Now" image={new URL("og/now.png", Astro.url)}>
  <span class="flex gap-1 items-baseline">
    <span class="flex-1">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">What I'm doing now</h1>
    </span>
  </span>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <Prose>
      <i>
        This is a now page inspired by
        <a href="https://sive.rs/now2" target="_blank">Derek Sivers</a>.
        <br />
        Updated on May 5, 2026.
      </i>
    </Prose>
  </div>

  <Prose>
    <p>
      <b>🖥️ Working:</b> I will join Radome for a 6-month internship starting in September. I’ll be working on a compliance and security platform for startups. I believe in the product and the vision.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>🎨 Personal projects:</b> I'm currently <a href="https://erenworld.github.io/interview" target="_blank">interviewing</a> top database engineers from MongoDB, AWS, PostgreSQL, and more. This project reflects my personality.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>📚 Reading:</b> I'm currently reading a second book about Elon Musk (The Book of Elon by Eric). I really like his dedication to work and his impact on civilization.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>⛰️ Spending time:</b> Mostly in Nancy, with friends. Simple things: watching movies, walking around the city, writing code, thinking, and drinking a lot of coffee.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>🎶 Listening:</b> to a lot of music lately, and Turkish rock, especially Duman and Mor ve Ötesi.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>🏍️ Watching:</b> I’m currently watching 
      <i>
        <a href="https://www.netflix.com/title/80021955" target="_blank">
          Better Call Saul
        </a>
      </i>. I think it's in my top 5 now.
    </p>

    <p>
      <b>👀 Looking forward to:</b> Having more quiet time for reading and writing, going deeper into my projects, and meeting curious people.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Layout>